# Sibling to .gitignore for `fd`-driven scans (e.g. lint walkers). Excludes
# verbatim third-party content we never want linted as natural language.
internal/spdx/embedded/

# Translated feature-fragment sources: English-tuned prose rules
# false-positive on Spanish and Ukrainian. The assembled docs/<lang>/FEATURES.md
# stays linted (machine-wrapped in a textlint-disable block).
docs/es/features.d/
docs/uk/features.d/
